{"id":"n56528-2-7","stage":4,"title":"미어지다 · 挤满","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n56528-2-7-1","ko":"짐이 너무 많은 것 아니야? 보따리가 미어지겠는데.","zh":"行李不会太多吧？看起来都快装不下了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"짐이","meaning":"行李，货物","explanation":"짐：行李，货物；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"짐","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71357","senseId":"1","lemma":"짐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짐이","audio":"/audio/add0f4fadc4e9cc274b8.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"많은","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많은","audio":"/audio/dac1aa733d550e544bce.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"아니야?","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니야","audio":"/audio/b8a273e5d75f1fd1734c.mp3"}},{"text":"보따리가","meaning":"囊，锦囊","explanation":"보따리：囊，锦囊；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"보따리","audio":"/audio/7d95767ffcd6476e3138.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58786","senseId":"2","lemma":"보따리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보따리가","audio":"/audio/3f98adef1295eeac1b66.mp3"}},{"text":"미어지겠는데.","meaning":"挤满，撑破","explanation":"미어지다：挤满，撑破；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"미어지다","audio":"/audio/7881dc7a437d761f3e94.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56528","senseId":"2","lemma":"미어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"미어지겠는데","audio":"/audio/845fafd3e78e22639105.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3d95bbb883f1e751","term":"짐","zh":"行李，货物","audio":"/audio/3d95bbb883f1e7513260.mp3","entryId":"71357","definition":"为搬到他处而打包的物品。","pronunciation":["짐"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"7d95767ffcd6476e","term":"보따리","zh":"囊，锦囊","audio":"/audio/7d95767ffcd6476e3138.mp3","entryId":"58786","definition":"(喻义)指心里的心事、想法或故事等。","pronunciation":["보따리"]},{"id":"7881dc7a437d761f","term":"미어지다","zh":"挤满，撑破","audio":"/audio/7881dc7a437d761f3e94.mp3","entryId":"56528","definition":"挤得爆满，好像要爆炸似的。","pronunciation":["미어지다","미여지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1da3b0787b377822df27.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n56528-2-7-2","ko":"이 정도는 괜찮아.","zh":"这点程度没问题的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"정도는","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정도는","audio":"/audio/9710286ea50e5d6c54d3.mp3"}},{"text":"괜찮아.","meaning":"没关系，无所谓，可以","explanation":"괜찮다：没关系，无所谓，可以；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"3","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"괜찮아","audio":"/audio/87dea6f32ecb5a9bbac8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"没关系，无所谓，可以","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"不用担心或没有问题，可以允许。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/44f70dfd09485d24559f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.969,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=56528","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":142,"sequenceScore":2.7957,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["行李不会太多吧？看起来都快装不下了。","这点程度没问题的。","春节假期你打算做什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["行李不会太多吧？看起来都快装不下了。","这点程度没问题的。","春节假期你打算做什么？"],"answer":1}]}
